WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:06.610
Danielle Colby is a dancer, an artist, a mother,
an activist, and a filmmaker, but you probably

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.460
know her best for her role on History Channel's
smash hit American Pickers.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:14.619
When she's not out picking through weird,
old artifacts herself, Colby holds down the

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:18.480
fort at American Archaeology, the Iowa-based
home base for the show.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.440
Here are a few fast facts about Colby's fascinating
life.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.840
Colby found her domestic life in trouble after
American Pickers debuted in 2004 and quickly

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.480
became a massive success.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.840
She told WQAD in 2012 that her new life wasn't
a good fit for her first husband, saying,

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:39.460
"Fame and notoriety are not easy for him to
deal with at all, so the relationship ended

00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:40.870
up not working out."

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:45.310
While her first marriage did not last, Colby
says her ex is a great father, and it's clear

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.900
from her Instagram that she's very close with
her two kids.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:52.500
She told WQAD that her favorite tattoos are
the ones her children drew for her: a circle

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.080
on one hand drawn by her son and a heart on
the other drawn by her daughter.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:01.140
Not only was Colby a roller derby player,
she was also the owner of a team, The Big

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.160
Mouth Mickies.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:06.580
Unfortunately, as Colby puts it, quote, "the
shelf life of a roller derby girl is like

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.120
three to five years," since the sport is known
for tearing you up.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.240
There's a reason their matches are called
bouts!

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:17.300
Happily, many of the Mickies went on to accompany
Colby in her pursuit of burlesque, proving

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.920
that the bonds of roller derby are durable
indeed.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.640
What is built on the track is built to last.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.860
Colby's primary passion outside the world
of picking is burlesque.

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:32.200
As Dannie Diesel, she performs with a shimmering
wardrobe of gowns, gloves, and props.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:35.750
She's backed by her band, Gin Rummy, with
whom she's traveled the country.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:40.260
While Colby's love of burlesque stems in part
from an appreciate for glitz and glamor, it's

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.960
an ideological pursuit as well.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.810
She told the Bemidji Pioneer in 2017,

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.680
"A lot of people are very nipped and tucked
in the striptease industry, so to go out there

00:01:49.681 --> 00:01:53.820
with a natural body and try to make people
emote with you and laugh and enjoy a moment

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.620
where everybody feels a little vulnerable,
that's the appeal."

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:01.200
As one of the co-hosts and principal "pickers"
of the show, Mike Wolfe is among the most

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.760
important and visible parts of American Pickers.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.940
But his relationship with Colby goes back
far further than their time together on screen.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:13.000
As she told Yuppie Punk in 2010, Mike had
been "picking" for 20 years prior to the show

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.780
and she had zero hesitation in signing on
when the History Channel decided to take a

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.300
chance on him.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:21.599
"[Mike had] been a really dear friend of mine
for almost ten years — and he has helped

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:25.880
me on all of my projects for about ten years
— so I knew without a doubt, if he was a

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:29.580
part of [American Pickers], not only would
it be successful, but it would be kickass

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.080
too."

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.260
People tend to assume Colby and Wolfe have
a romantic history, when they do not.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:35.980
Colby confessed,

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.460
"I get a lot of emails from people asking
if me and Mike are married.

00:02:39.469 --> 00:02:40.870
Well, Mike's taken.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:41.860
And not by me!"

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:46.980
Colby's hobbies extend beyond tattoos, picking,
roller derbies, and burlesque: she's also

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.460
fascinated by bugs.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:53.220
She has an enormous tattoo of a fly on her
forearm, in fact, done by Chewie, a tattoo

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.540
artist from Moline, Illinois.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:59.480
When interviewed in 2010, Colby gushed over
her ink — Chewie also did her knuckle tattoos,

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:03.380
which read "HOLD FAST," and and the plan was
for her work to go much, much bigger.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.920
"She'll be finishing my left arm, which is
all entomology.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.740
I love bugs."

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:13.780
Colby is also an ardent philanthropist who
has donated her time, money, and publicity

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.040
to more than a few charities, organizations,
and causes including Hurricane Maria relief

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.140
work in Puerto Rico.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.960
One that's dear to her heart is Batey Girls,
part of the Batey Rehab Project, which sells

00:03:23.969 --> 00:03:28.389
jewelry to help provide economic opportunities
for girls and women in the Dominican Republic

00:03:28.389 --> 00:03:31.020
at high risk of sex trafficking and domestic
violence.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.879
Colby's website and social media accounts
are all boldly emblazoned with the group's

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:38.580
colorful logo and a link to their website
— one that's certainly worth the click.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.739
What more could Colby possibly pack into her
life?

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:46.740
Well, it turns out there's one more field
she's intent on conquering: the world of documentary

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:47.240
filmmaking.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:51.959
Colby's most notable credit as of the making
of this video is as executive producer on

00:03:51.959 --> 00:03:56.189
the documentary Tempest Storm: World's Oldest
Exotic Dancer.

00:03:56.189 --> 00:04:01.110
Storm, who has been linked to everyone from
JFK to Elvis Presley, blew up her life when

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:05.639
she committed to a then-controversial interracial
marriage, and spends much of the film looking

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.420
to reconcile with her estranged family.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:12.890
Colby positively gushes when it comes to describing
her part in the production, both as a historian

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.349
and as a fellow dancer.

00:04:14.349 --> 00:04:15.799
She wrote on her Facebook page,

00:04:15.799 --> 00:04:18.930
"Thank you for paving the way for the rest
of us B Grrrls.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.280
I can't wait to perform with you in Vegas
soon!"

